{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Integrate the Adyen Issuing SDK by embedding XCFrameworks directly into your Xcode project."}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"kind":"article","primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"type":"heading","anchor":"Overview","text":"Overview","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"If you cannot use Swift Package Manager, you can integrate the SDK by manually embedding the pre-built XCFrameworks into your project. This guide covers which frameworks to include, how to configure your project, and what to import in your code.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Download-the-SDK","text":"Download the SDK","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Obtain the SDK distribution package from Adyen. The package contains the following structure:","type":"text"}]},{"syntax":"text","code":["Build-IssuingSDK\/","├── XCFrameworks\/","│   ├── CardProvisioningSessions.xcframework","│   ├── CardProvisioning.xcframework","│   ├── CardProvisioningExtension.xcframework","│   ├── CardSessions.xcframework","│   ├── IssuingCore.xcframework","│   └── IssuingCommon.xcframework","└── Documentation\/"],"type":"codeListing"},{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Required Frameworks","anchor":"Required-Frameworks"},{"type":"heading","level":3,"anchor":"Network-Token-Provisioning-Sessions-Approach","text":"Network Token Provisioning (Sessions Approach)"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The following framework is ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"required"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" for the sessions-based provisioning:"}]},{"header":"row","rows":[[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Framework"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Purpose"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"CardProvisioningSessions.xcframework","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Session-ba